    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safety guarantee for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_light_retriever" kindref="compound">ProcessLightRetriever</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Pattern:</bold> READ_ONLY_SNAPSHOT <linebreak/>
 <bold>Atomicity:</bold> READ_ONLY <linebreak/>
 <bold>Conflict Resolution:</bold> NO_CONFLICTS</para>
<para>Retriever is a read-only façade over the graph layer. All queries operate over consistent snapshots. No mutations or locks.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>All operations are read-only; no state mutation. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>No locks required; snapshot-based reads. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Thread-safe for unlimited concurrent queries. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
